</head>
<body>
    <input type="text" id="inputBox">
    <svg id="glassIcon" width="100" height="100" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
        <path d="M50 50 l-10 10" fill="none" stroke="black" stroke-width="1" />
    </svg>
    <button id="putButton">Put Something Here</button>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

### Step 2: CSS Styling

